WEBVTT

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:45.000
<b>Everyone Assemble</b>

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Fufufu... In that case, we'll 
decide this with volleyball.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.430
But instead of a ball, we'll use... this!

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:53.290
W-What did you say?!

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.950
And it just ends there?!

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.000
What happens next?

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.260
What will they use instead of a ball?

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:04.470
Crap... I lent the latest volume 
to Oga, and he still has it!

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:06.380
It's already late.

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:10.180
But I won't be able to sleep 
unless I know what happens next!

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:12.520
That's it! Alaindelon!

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.830
Would you dimensionally 
transfer me to Oga's house...?

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:24.450
I wonder if he and Hilda-san also cleared 
out when Baby Beel left Oga's place?

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:34.430
Furuichi-dono, please use this when you 
just can't bear with my absence any longer.

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:43.600
A discount coupon for the municipal pool?!

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:46.100
What's with that?!

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.850
That was pretty horrid...

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.520
Damn that shitty brat, Lamia...

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:59.900
And now it looks like that 
brat Lamia's here again!

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.200
I'll kill you, you...

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:12.390
You have a strange way of trying 
to get rid of me, Lamia.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:15.460
No... I'm Shiroyama.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:21.010
I was going to ring the 
buzzer, but it's very late.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:26.830
While I was trying to figure my next move, 
I heard your voice from the bathroom.

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:29.020
You're creepy.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:31.280
What do you want anyway?

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:33.250
Where are you leading me?

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.370
Kanzaki-san and Himekawa-san 
are waiting for you.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.030
They want to go at it again?

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.280
No.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:41.780
They want to talk about Tojo.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:42.990
Tojo?

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:43.870
Yeah.

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:45.590
You see...

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.200
Tojo...

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.040
Let's mix it up.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.780
Uh...

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:54.250
Kanzaki and Himekawa.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.550
Oh, right.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:59.880
Hey, Kanzaki and... uh, 
Himekawa, right? What's up?

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:05.130
It's like we don't even exist? 
Damn, you piss me off.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:08.440
Stop playing innocent! We know all about it!

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:09.380
It?

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:12.710
You've taken all of our followers!

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:16.290
No clue.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:21.480
It is true that the balance of power 
at Ishiyama is rapidly changing.

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.740
Is it?

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:26.360
Yes. Since these two were beaten by Oga,

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:29.580
most of the rank-and-file have proclaimed 
themselves as being "with Tojo".

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:33.760
Perhaps they believe you're 
the only one able to beat Oga.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:39.700
But that's simply because they 
decided to give up on you two.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.120
It has nothing to do with us.

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:43.010
Why, you...

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.880
Fine, whatever.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:48.500
You got a problem with me, come and fight!

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:51.350
You're on, asshole!

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.730
They are no opponents for you, Tora.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:11.950
And so, we're here.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:15.480
We don't like it, but we'll let you join us.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.080
Let's go beat the crap outta Tojo.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.340
Huh?

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:22.430
Huh, what? You heard us!

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:25.040
We told you to help us!

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.700
Now, let's go!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:27.480
Huh?

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.640
Listen! Don't get the wrong idea.

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:36.980
We want to beat you up, 
too. But Tojo comes first!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:40.970
Yes. We have to get rid of him immediately.

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:44.740
For the time being, let's 
fight on the same side!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:48.240
Um, thanks but no thanks. I'll do it myself.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.420
Listen! Don't get the wrong idea!

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:55.360
We want to beat you up, 
too! But Tojo comes first!

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:59.490
Yes! We have to get rid of him immediately.

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:02.510
For the time being, let's 
fight on the same side!

00:06:02.510 --> 00:06:03.880
They're stuck in a loop?!

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:07.270
Sorry... They want to ask for your help.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.450
What the heck?

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.120
You've gotta be kiddin' me.

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:15.640
They should beg! Maybe I'll  squeeze 
out where Tojo is and bury 'em.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:18.650
Well, my main objective today is Tojo.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:22.400
Okay then. If you really 
wanna come, stick with me.

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:25.800
I'd rather not, but...

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.650
Just this once, got it?

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:35.200
What's the matter? You don't seem well.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.790
You'll never survive like that.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.190
Hold it right there, thief!

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:16.450
Right!

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:19.080
Times like this, there's 
only one thing to do!

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.710
We'll set things off with a big bang!

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.450
The school? Now?

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:29.760
Fine, I don't really mind, but...

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.500
Talk to you later.

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:38.220
Hey, Oga-chan.

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:40.200
What're you doing here this late?

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:40.980
Aizawa.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:44.350
Plus, you've got quite 
the odd group with you.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:46.750
Was that Tojo you were 
speaking to on the phone?

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:48.230
And what if it was?

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:51.250
Perfect. We'll have you lead us to him.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:52.490
Hold it!

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:56.130
Aizawa-san, please leave this to us.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:01.000
When we win, you'll 
recognize us officially...

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.310
As Tojo-san's underlings!

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:06.170
Uh... Who are you people?

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:07.870
Hold it!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.510
In that case, let us join in as well!

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:14.260
Everyone should get an equal chance!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:17.510
Idiots... You don't have what it takes.

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:21.020
Hold it, hold it! We'll 
be the ones to get Oga!

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:25.400
Me, me!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.020
You're a cheat!

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:36.110
The hell?

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.350
This is gonna be annoying.

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:39.760
Do you know what time it is?

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.460
Please think of the trouble 
you're causing the neighborhood.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:43.540
Wait, you!

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:46.290
Our fight isn't over yet!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:49.290
Beat everyone there, and I'll fight you.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.260
They don't think much of us...

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.050
Yeah, seriously.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:58.250
Bring it on, Himekawa!

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:00.580
What's the matter, Kanzaki?

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:04.060
Do you realize who you're barking at?

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.550
Looks like you need to be taught a lesson.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.660
What? Over already?

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:28.640
Next!

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:37.330
What're you doing? Let's go.

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.890
R-Right...

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:44.980
Hold it, you!

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:48.400
We're not your lackeys, got it?

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.580
You shouldn't be walking in front!

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:52.400
God, they're a pain...

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:54.230
Hold it, damn you!

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.400
Oga!

00:09:57.600 --> 00:10:01.410
It's been almost 3 days 
since the master became ill.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.660
Do we really have time to 
be taking things slowly?

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:08.150
True... But haste must be avoided.

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:13.620
The cure we are pursuing is to 
restore the lost link itself.

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:19.180
The only one who can recover it... 
and restore the bond... is that man.

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:24.180
In other words, unless that man, of his 
own will, goes to get Beelze-sama back,

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.230
there is no point.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:30.190
That man should just drop dead!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.320
Lamia...

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:35.440
What? Still angry after he spanked your ass?

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:36.950
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:40.130
Don't say "ass" in front of a lady!

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:41.550
And besides...

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:45.950
You can't show favor to one prince only!

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.210
Sorry, Lamia.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:53.710
Well, I like you a lot, Miss 
Hilda, so I don't mind.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:08.310
Master...

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:25.030
Go on, Aizawa-san. Go right ahead.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:27.850
Huh? Who are you people?

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:29.850
We'll cut off their advance here!

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:33.680
We said not to run out in front of us!

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.080
Hey! Hold it, Oga!

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:41.050
Cut off their advance? Look 
here, people, this isn't a war.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:42.740
It <i>is</i> a war!

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:44.700
A war for Ishiyama's honor.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:48.510
Yeah. We can't let some 
first-year walk all over us.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:53.030
Pretty much every student 
is gathered here now.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:57.390
Oookay... Well, don't overdo it.

00:11:57.390 --> 00:11:59.490
Tojo-san is calling for me, so...

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:00.740
I said, wait!

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.150
You're the one who'll be waiting!

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:05.040
You don't seem to get it!

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:16.800
Sheesh...

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.500
This might be a little much...

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:23.240
Beat 'em to a pulp!

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:38.590
What the...?

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:39.440
What's wrong?

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.400
What happened?

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:44.910
Honestly... You make me laugh.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:49.910
A single first year surrounded 
by every student in the school?

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:52.660
And you call that a war of honor?!

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.680
Have you no shame?!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:05.690
Kunieda!

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:06.280
Kunieda!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:07.020
Kunieda...

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:07.760
The Red Tails!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.010
Kunieda...

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:11.770
You? Why?

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:17.520
Go. I'll handle them here.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:18.880
Seriously?

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:19.980
The Queen...

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.640
The Queen's got the Red Tails with her!

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:25.360
They're all siding with Oga?

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:28.910
I'll say this: Don't misunderstand me.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:32.160
I owe you one. That's all.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:33.890
Kunieda...

00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:40.200
Don't go cracking up just 'cause 
Kunieda's bunch showed up!

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:43.550
Do your homework, brush your 
teeth, and then start over again!

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:47.300
The MK5 is here!

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:46.810
The MK5!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:48.730
What's with the pose?

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:49.980
Are they screwing with us?

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:52.110
You're killing the mood!

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.560
Look, we've got another over here!

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:56.560
Who is it? I recognize him...

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:57.560
Good night!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:00.620
Aoi-chan, you look lovely in your Hakama...

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:01.070
Good...

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:02.900
...night?

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:08.070
Now that I think about it, we still 
need to settle things, don't we?

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:11.990
Could I at least get to fight Aoi-chan?

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.480
Good night...!

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.420
You're bein' too friendly, Creepokawa.

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:24.420
You're pretty strong.

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:28.240
But you don't think you'll be able to 
beat us with something like that, right?

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:30.180
What was your name again? 
Shimura or something?

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:32.430
ShiMAmura!

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:33.430
Behind you.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.030
Quadruple pistols?!

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:58.200
We suck!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.540
<b>Wiped Out Instantly</b>

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.940
Wow.

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:05.220
As long as they have their weapons, 
those girls aren't losing to anyone.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.230
Now, stand back.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.780
I will create a path.

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:31.220
Shingetsu sword school.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.440
First style, reformed!

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:37.190
Mountain Shatter, Chrysanthemum Cut!

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.460
Chasing Flash!

00:15:47.110 --> 00:15:48.470
What is it, Kaoru?

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:52.440
Yeah... There was just a strange explosion...

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.830
Explosion?

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:55.800
But I ain't lit 'em yet.

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.410
No, not those.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.980
Man, what a shock!

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:05.480
You said there were gonna be fireworks, so I 
came around, but what's with the crowd so late?

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:06.880
Crowd?

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.500
You didn't know?

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.240
W... B... Huh?

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:13.180
Fireworks? You meant <i>real</i> fireworks?!

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.740
And where did you get them?

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:17.730
I swiped 'em from my job at the festival.

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:19.680
That's a crime, you know.

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:22.250
Stop grinning like a fool, damn you.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:27.010
I was thinkin' that if he saw some big 
fireworks, it might cheer the little guy up.

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:31.670
Anyway Shoji, what did you mean by a crowd?

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:34.680
I think, like, all the students are here.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:38.720
They're tryin' to make a name for themselves 
and become your followers, Tojo-san.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.180
Every student in the school?

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:43.380
That's ridiculous. Who spread 
that bogus story around?

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:45.870
Oh, that was me.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:49.770
It was <i>you</i>?

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:53.100
Well, they were all so annoying 
trying to be my lackeys...

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:55.080
So I was like, "do a good job, and sure."

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:57.030
And he wasn't hardly trying!

00:16:57.300 --> 00:17:01.250
Why not? In the end, it's 
how this school works.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.950
Everyone gets together, fights,

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:06.100
and the one standing at the end is the boss.

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:07.290
What's wrong with that?

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.630
Let's make a nice big boom...

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.530
With both fighting and fireworks...

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:26.710
So, Oga Tatsumi... I've heard about you.

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:30.290
You're this baby's parent, aren't you?

00:18:30.570 --> 00:18:33.130
That explains why you 
were unsettled back then.

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:35.030
Why didn't you tell me?

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.820
Whatever. I'll give 'im back to you.

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:44.330
I want to fight you for real.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:48.450
Look, it's daddy!

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:53.340
I don't wanna hear, "I went easy on you 
'cause I was worried about my kid."

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.400
Or maybe you'd fight even 
stronger if you had to...

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:00.910
...take him back?

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.160
Sorry, but neither.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:07.790
I'm fighting for myself.

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:10.770
In the first place, that ain't my kid.

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:13.770
Just like you, I've been caring 
for him after picking him up.

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:14.800
That's all.

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:18.970
Whether he comes back to 
me, or sticks to you...

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:20.780
That's...

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:24.300
...something he'll decide for himself.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:50.650
Baby Beel...

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:12.530
Why, you...

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:13.970
You...

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:19.510
Don't underestimate me!

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:26.120
You cut the link for my sake?!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.740
Who asked you?!

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:32.370
Your tantrums...

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:42.630
...to me, they're no worse 
than a static shock!

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:07.620
Baby Beel...

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:19.210
Looks like he's completely back to normal.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:25.420
But that man... He opened Beelze-sama's 
eyes just by calling out to him.

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:29.360
He's really taken to him, I see...

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:31.970
Don't pull on me!

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:37.510
You're gettin' annoying, Baby Beel!

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:40.230
Let go! I'll kill you!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.750
Hey, come on! What're you doing?

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:44.490
See? You're totally his parent.

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:47.380
Ah, so his name is Baby Beel.

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:48.990
Good for him, the little bugger.

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:56.500
Now then, let's hurry and start this fight.

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:01.400
I can hardly wait to fight you again.

00:22:01.400 --> 00:22:03.650
Put him down already, Oga.

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.180
Yeah.

00:24:01.860 --> 00:24:03.540
Hey, come on! Tell me what happens next!

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:03.970
Huh?

00:24:03.970 --> 00:24:05.240
I can't wait until next week!

00:24:05.240 --> 00:24:05.590
Uh?

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:07.090
I wanna know so bad I can't sleep!

00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:10.440
What does Count Poo intend to use 
instead of a ball to play volleyball?

00:24:10.440 --> 00:24:11.430
Oh, about that?!

00:24:11.430 --> 00:24:12.700
Please, Oga!

00:24:12.700 --> 00:24:16.600
Hurry and get your fight with Tojo over 
with, so I can read the rest of Gohan-kun!

00:24:17.160 --> 00:24:20.940
On the next Beelzebub: Who do you 
think is Ishiyama's Strongest?

00:24:21.440 --> 00:24:26.230
Alaindelon... My room, with you absent, 
suddenly feels so big and roomy...

00:24:26.230 --> 00:24:28.100
What the hell was that?
